    <meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="description" content="LONDON, 1 October 2026: TP ICAP Group, a world-leading provider of market infrastructure and data, has been named Global Capital’s &quot;Global Interdealer Broker of the Year&quot; for the third consecutive year.Operating through its client-facing brands ICAP and Tullett Prebon, TP ICAP was once again recognised for its consistent delivery of exceptional client service, deep market expertise and continued innovation across global financial markets." />
