 </div> </div> </div>  <div class="coh-container press-release-container coh-ce-d34488df" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-ce128880" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-a26f3574" >    <div class="coh-container coh-ce-709d78c7" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-cfc40150" > <div class="coh-row coh-row-xl coh-row-visible-xl" data-coh-row-match-heights="{&quot;xl&quot;:{&quot;target&quot;:&quot;none&quot;}}"> <div class="coh-row-inner coh-ce-10b2716f"> <div class="coh-column coh-col-xl coh-col-xl-push-0 coh-col-xl-pull-0 coh-col-xl-offset-0" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-16226e20" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-d6e0ac38" >  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-a0ef13b1" > 01 Oct 2026</p> </div>    <div class="coh-container coh-ce-be69eee1" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-9505cf28" > </div> </div>     <div class="coh-container coh-ce-5af8fb69" >  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-416244a4" >4 minutes</p> </div>  </div> </div> <div class="coh-column coh-col-xl coh-col-xl-push-0 coh-col-xl-pull-0 coh-col-xl-offset-0" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-3d6d7161" >  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-cf163608" >  <p class="coh-paragraph coh-ce-c6c6bbb9" >SHARE</p> </div>  <div class="coh-container coh-ce-8f469be5" >  <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="coh-link linkedin-link coh-style-colour-change-on-hover coh-ce-1584c515" target="_self" >  <svg class="coh-inline-element" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 36 36" width="36" height="36"> <path/ class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-a0e2a856" d="M28.224 6c.979 0 1.775.775 1.775 1.73v20.538c0 .956-.796 1.732-1.775 1.732H7.77C6.793 30 6 29.224 6 28.268V7.731C6 6.775 6.793 6 7.77 6zm-15.105 8.997H9.556v11.454h3.563V14.997zm9.062-.284c-1.731 0-2.893.95-3.368 1.85h-.049v-1.566h-3.412v11.454h3.556v-5.665c0-1.495.282-2.942 2.134-2.942 1.827 0 1.85 1.709 1.85 3.037v5.57h3.559v-6.282c0-3.084-.666-5.456-4.27-5.456zM11.339 9.304c-1.144 0-2.066.925-2.066 2.064 0 1.14.922 2.065 2.066 2.065 1.138 0 2.063-.925 2.063-2.065s-.925-2.064-2.063-2.064z" fill-rule="evenodd"></path/> </svg> </a>  <a href="javascript:void(0)" class="coh-link twitter-link coh-style-colour-change-on-hover coh-ce-1584c515" target="_self" >  <svg class="coh-inline-element" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 509.64" width="36" height="36" shape-rendering="geometricPrecision" text-rendering="geometricPrecision" image-rendering="optimizeQuality" fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd"> <path/ class="coh-inline-element coh-ce-a0e2a856" d="M323.74 148.35h36.12l-78.91 90.2 92.83 122.73h-72.69l-56.93-74.43-65.15 74.43h-36.14l84.4-96.47-89.05-116.46h74.53l51.46 68.04 59.53-68.04zm-12.68 191.31h20.02l-129.2-170.82H180.4l130.66 170.82z" fill-rule="nonzero"></path/> </svg> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div>  <div class="coh-container coh-style-body-large---fslucas-medium coh-ce-ebb604dd" >  <div class="coh-wysiwyg" >     </div> </div>  <div class="coh-container coh-style-content---body-regular---fslucas-regular-28lh coh-ce-943848f5" > <p><span lang="EN-GB"><strong>LONDON, 1 October 2026:&nbsp;</strong>TP ICAP Group, a world-leading provider of market infrastructure and data, has been named Global Capital’s "Global Interdealer Broker of the Year" for the third consecutive year.</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">Operating through its client-facing brands ICAP and Tullett Prebon, TP ICAP was once again recognised for its consistent delivery of exceptional client service, deep market expertise and continued innovation across global financial markets.</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">The award builds on a strong year of industry recognition for TP ICAP. The Group also retained Euromoney’s ‘Best Institutional FX Broker’ title, underscoring its position as a trusted partner to clients navigating increasingly complex and volatile markets.</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB"><strong>Commenting on the achievement, Dan Fields, CEO of TP ICAP’s Global Broking division, said:</strong></span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">"Winning Global Interdealer Broker of the Year for a third consecutive year, while also retaining Euromoney's Best Institutional FX Broker award, is a fantastic achievement and a reflection of the expertise, dedication and teamwork of colleagues across our business.&nbsp;</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">“In fast-moving and often volatile markets, our clients rely on us for liquidity, insight and execution, and these awards recognise the commitment of our teams around the world to delivering the high levels of service and support our clients expect. I would like to thank our colleagues for their hard work and our clients for their continued trust and partnership."</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">As well as winning the global award, TP ICAP was also named GlobalCapital’s "Americas IDB of the Year" and "EMEA &amp; APAC IDB of the Year".&nbsp;</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB"><strong>ENDS</strong></span><br><br>&nbsp;</p><p><span lang="EN-GB"><strong>About TP ICAP Group plc</strong></span><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">TP ICAP is the network at the centre of the world's most complex financial markets.</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">We connect market participants to liquidity, data and insight across global financial, energy and commodities markets. Through our portfolio of businesses, we help clients discover prices, manage risk, execute transactions and make informed decisions.</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB">Sitting at the point where liquidity is formed, prices are discovered and transactions occur, TP ICAP plays a vital role in supporting well-functioning markets. The Group operates from more than 60 offices across 28 countries worldwide.</span></p><p><a href="http://www.tpicap.com"><span lang="EN-GB">www.tpicap.com</span></a><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span lang="EN-GB"><strong>Media Contact&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span lang="EN-GB">Tom Gilbert | +44 7741231950 |&nbsp;</span><a href="mailto:%20thomas.gilbert@tpicap.com%C2%A0"><span lang="EN-GB">thomas.gilbert@tpicap.com</span></a><span lang="EN-GB">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span lang="EN-GB"></span></p></div>   </div> </div> </div> </div>  <script class="coh-inline-element">document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", function(event) { 
    jQuery(document).ready(function( $ ){

        var pageURL = document.URL;
        var pageTitle = document.title;
        
        pageTitle = pageTitle.substring(0, pageTitle.indexOf('|'));

        $('.linkedin-link').attr("href", "https://www.linkedin.com/shareArticle?mini=true&url=" + pageURL + "&title=" + pageTitle);
        $('.twitter-link').attr("href", "https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?text=" + pageTitle + "&url=" + pageURL + "&original_referer=" + pageURL);
    
    });
});</script> </div> </article> 

